sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant W as React page
  participant Q as Query/API client
  participant G as Express gateway
  participant D as PostgreSQL/service
  U->>W: Open route or select control
  W->>Q: Fetch typed view model
  Q->>G: Authenticated HTTP request
  G->>D: Query or service call
  D-->>G: Canonical rows/result
  G-->>Q: JSON plus timestamps/state
  Q-->>W: Cached server state
  W-->>U: KPI, chart, table, or explicit error
